rtex at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n(y-k)^{2}=4p(x-h),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nWe can rewrite the given equation as \n\n$$\n(y-2)^{2}=4(6)(x-0).\n$$\n\nIt is now clear that our equation is of the standard type with $p=6.$ \n\nComparing our equation with the standard equation, we can see that we have $h=0$ and $k=2.$ Therefore, the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola are $(0,2).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e5c471f1-7322-5546-9274-391fcdaf58fb"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e5c471f1-7322-5546-9274-391fcdaf58fb" :answer-field/id #uuid "e5c471f1-7322-5546-9274-391fcdaf58fb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6e2d5e63-bd1a-5877-af7c-ee76ddd010f0" "answer-981388fd-f53b-5c00-b3df-ab2e5c3b2ce6" "answer-b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e" "answer-52e0fa5e-82bb-5d66-89a7-3e3c3038f2fd" "answer-f0551018-f5de-55f6-9abc-7cd335232b8d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6e2d5e63-bd1a-5877-af7c-ee76ddd010f0" :answer/id #uuid "6e2d5e63-bd1a-5877-af7c-ee76ddd010f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(-2,6)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-981388fd-f53b-5c00-b3df-ab2e5c3b2ce6" :answer/id #uuid "981388fd-f53b-5c00-b3df-ab2e5c3b2ce6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e" :answer/id #uuid "b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(0,2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-52e0fa5e-82bb-5d66-89a7-3e3c3038f2fd" :answer/id #uuid "52e0fa5e-82bb-5d66-89a7-3e3c3038f2fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(2,0)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f0551018-f5de-55f6-9abc-7cd335232b8d" :answer/id #uuid "f0551018-f5de-55f6-9abc-7cd335232b8d" :answer