p(x-h),\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is constant.\n\nWe can rewrite the given equation as \n\n$$\n(y-2)^{2}=4(6)(x-0).\n$$\n\nIt is now clear that our equation is of the standard type with $p=6.$ \n\nComparing our equation with the standard equation, we can see that we have $h=0$ and $k=2.$ Therefore, the coordinates of the vertex of the parabola are $(0,2).$"] ["question-b967fd96-33d4-527f-b0fa-13d15459432d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-e5c471f1-7322-5546-9274-391fcdaf58fb" :answer-field/id #uuid "e5c471f1-7322-5546-9274-391fcdaf58fb"] ["answer-6e2d5e63-bd1a-5877-af7c-ee76ddd010f0" :answer/id #uuid "6e2d5e63-bd1a-5877-af7c-ee76ddd010f0"] ["answer-6e2d5e63-bd1a-5877-af7c-ee76ddd010f0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6e2d5e63-bd1a-5877-af7c-ee76ddd010f0" :answer/value "(-2,6)"] ["answer-981388fd-f53b-5c00-b3df-ab2e5c3b2ce6" :answer/id #uuid "981388fd-f53b-5c00-b3df-ab2e5c3b2ce6"] ["answer-981388fd-f53b-5c00-b3df-ab2e5c3b2ce6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-981388fd-f53b-5c00-b3df-ab2e5c3b2ce6" :answer/value "(0,-2)"] ["answer-b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e" :answer/id #uuid "b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e"] ["answer-b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b173c4e6-d3a3-5998-84d4-1bcdb40cef0e" :answer/value "(0,2)"] ["answer-52e0fa5e-82bb-5d66-89a7-3e3c3038f2fd" :answer/id #uuid "52e0fa5e-82bb-5d66-89a7-3e3c3038f2fd"] ["answer-52e0fa5e-82bb-5d66-89a7-3e3c3038f2fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-52e0fa5e-82bb-5d66-89a7-3e3c3038f2fd" :answer/value "(2,0)"] ["answer-f0551018-f5de-55f6-9abc-7cd335232b8d" :answer/id #uuid "f0551018-f5de-55f6-9abc-7cd335232b8d"] ["answer-f0551018-f5de-55f6-9abc-7cd335232b8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f0551018-f5de-55f6-9abc-7cd335232b8d" :answer/value "(6,2)"] ["answer-field-e5c471f1-7322-5546-9274-391fcdaf58fb" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-e5c471f1-7322-5546-9274-391fcdaf58fb" :answer-field/type :answer-